This boundary contains frontend applications and reusable frontend libraries.
Later capability pieces own the exact files placed beneath these roots.

## Directory map

- Boundary root: `{{frontend.root}}`
- Runnable application packages: `{{frontend.appsRoot}}/`
- Reusable frontend libraries: `{{frontend.libsRoot}}/`

Applications own composition, platform entry points, and application-specific
adapters. Libraries hold reusable UI, state, data-access, and utility
boundaries. Shared UI belongs in an explicit library rather than being copied
between applications. Generated artifacts are outputs, not maintained source,
and must remain distinguishable from both application and library code.

This structure does not select a framework, build tool, platform, or test
runner.
